{"unit_id":"tag:02YT:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，若 <MATH_0001> 是概形（schemes），且 <MATH_0002> 是态射（morphism），则每个纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0003> 都与开子概形 <MATH_0004> 等同。定义的最后一个条件恰好表示 <MATH_0005>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n显然，开子空间的族 <MATH_0006>，其环境对象为 <MATH_0007>，构成集合（set）（因为 <MATH_0008> 是位点（site），因而是集合（set））。此外，可以将 <MATH_0009> 变成范畴（category），令态射（morphisms）为子函子的包含（inclusions）（由引理 <REF_0001>，它们自动是开浸入（open immersions））。最后，定义 <REF_0002> 给出了 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）<MATH_0010> 的概念，位于范畴（category）<MATH_0011> 中。因此，与拓扑空间（topological space）的情形一样（见《位点（Sites）》的例 <REF_0003>），通过适当选择一个由覆盖（coverings）组成的集合（set），可以得到 Zariski 位点（site），其代数空间（algebraic space）为 <MATH_0012>。\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"inclusions","target_term":"包含"},{"source_term":"open immersions","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"测试对象，忠实保留来源词形；未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"测试箭头；未批准。"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"开子空间的拉回；未批准。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"开子空间与覆盖的大小；未批准。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"大小条件及覆盖结构；未批准。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"开子空间的范畴；未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"范畴中的箭头；未批准。"},{"source_term":"inclusions","target_term":"包含","context":"子函子的箭头；未批准。"},{"source_term":"open immersions","target_term":"开浸入","context":"包含的性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"位点的覆盖；未批准。"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"类比中的对象；未批准。"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章名；未批准。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"位点中选取的覆盖；未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"位点所属的对象；未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02YZ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是代数空间（algebraic space），其基底为 <MATH_0003>。一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>小 Zariski 位点（small Zariski site）<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，其代数空间（algebraic space）为 <MATH_0005>，是上面描述的位点（sites）之一。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"small Zariski site","target_term":"小 Zariski 位点"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"位点所属对象；未批准。"},{"source_term":"small Zariski site","target_term":"小 Zariski 位点","context":"所定义术语；未批准。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"上文构造的结构；未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02YT:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n因此，这给出了一个概念，说明某事在代数空间（algebraic space）上 Zariski 局部成立是什么意思；我们将这样使用这个概念。一般而言，Zariski 拓扑（topology）对于我们的目的还不够细。例如，可以考虑一个代数空间（algebraic space）上的 Zariski 层（sheaves）的范畴（category）。将会看到，这并不是应该考虑的结构，即使对于拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）也是如此。只有使用平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）或 fppf 位点（site），其所属对象为 <MATH_0001>，来定义拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）时，才能得到所期望的结果。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["Zariski","fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"局部性与层范畴的对象；未批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"讨论的 Zariski 拓扑；未批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"范畴中的对象；未批准。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层构成的范畴；未批准。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"需在更细位点上定义的层；未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"位点类型，保留重音；未批准。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"定义层所用的结构；未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
