{"unit_id":"tag:02X3:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0001> 上的分离条件，是关于对角态射（morphism）<MATH_0002> 的条件。先列出对角自动具有的性质。由于对角按定义可表（representable），下面的引理有意义（通过定义 <REF_0001>）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"分离条件的对象；未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"对角；未批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"对角的定义性质；未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02X4:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是包含在 <MATH_0002> 中的概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0003> 是 <MATH_0004> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。设 <MATH_0005> 是对角态射（morphism）。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0006> 局部有限型（locally of finite type）；\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0007> 是单态射（monomorphism）；\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0008> 分离（separated）；并且\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0009> 局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"所考察对象；未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"对角；未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型","context":"对角性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射","context":"对角性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"对角性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限","context":"对角性质；未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02X4:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 的一个表示。如引理 <REF_0001> 的证明中所见，图（diagram）<MATH_0003> 是笛卡尔（cartesian）的。因此，由引理 <REF_0002>，只须证明 <MATH_0004> 具有引理所列性质。（注意，性质 (1) 至 (4) 中的每一项都出现在注记 <REF_0003> 与 <REF_0004> 的列表中。）由于 <MATH_0005> 是等价关系（equivalence relation），它是单态射（monomorphism）。因此它分离（separated），依据是《概形（Schemes）》的引理 <REF_0005>。由于 <MATH_0006> 是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）等价关系（equivalence relation），可知 <MATH_0007> 平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）。于是 <MATH_0008> 局部有限型（locally of finite type）。随后由《态射（Morphisms）》的引理 <REF_0006> 得到 <MATH_0009> 局部有限型（locally of finite type）。最后，由于它是单态射（monomorphism），其纤维有限（finite）。因此它局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite），依据是《态射（Morphisms）》的引理 <REF_0007>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"对角的基底变换图；未批准。"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔","context":"该图性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系","context":"表示中的关系；未批准。"},{"source_term":"monomorphism","target_term":"单态射","context":"关系的性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"关系的性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"引用章名；未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"关系性质，保留重音；未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"投影性质，保留重音；未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型","context":"投影及关系性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；未批准。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"纤维性质；未批准。"},{"source_term":"locally quasi-finite","target_term":"局部拟有限","context":"关系的性质；未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02X3:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面列出一些常见的分离条件，它们相对于基底概形（base scheme）<MATH_0001>。这些条件还有绝对意义下的概念，我们将在《空间的性质》的第 <REF_0001> 节讨论。此外，我们将在《空间的态射（Morphisms）》的第 <REF_0002> 节讨论代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）的分离条件。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基底概形"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"base scheme","target_term":"基底概形","context":"相对分离条件的基底；未批准。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名中的术语；未批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"下文考虑的箭头两端；未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"下文讨论分离条件的对象；未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
